<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russian forces continue high-intensity strikes on Ukrainian civilian sites, killing dozens at a humanitarian hub, an aid centre and power infrastructure, while Ukrainian drones are now being used to transport wounded troops from the front lines. Russia is also equipping its drones with propaganda messages and cyber threats. In the Oleshky area a cease-fire is being exploited by Russian troops to move forces despite ongoing attacks on aid vehicles. Melania Trump is set to host Ukrainian and Russian officials at the White House. Battle-related deaths totaled 75,767 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/us-first-lady-melania-trump-to-host-ukrainian-and-russian-officials-at-white-house&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/04/ukraine-31-dead-over-45-missing-after-russian-bombing-in-zaporizhzhia&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261105-zelensky-in-spain-for-talks-with-world-leaders-as-kyiv-seeks-to-strengthen-air-defences&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/drone-strike-sets-ozon-warehouse-ablaze-in-southern-russia&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/world/europe/russian-strike-zaporizhzhia-ukraine.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168712&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261105-dozens-dead-and-missing-after-russian-strike-on-ukrainian-aid-centre&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNN2FQN0Z1ZnczU2V2RGdkMnNiTGh1UWtfdEs1NWtwbHhEX2d1aDlKaTRpcjZXWmw0dC1SM0xoZ1Ytajh4Y0NfVTlmZFVybG9wdHF5TFhwSHBVcEFZV3RkZUVKQjA